WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.811
Four RCMP Commissioners since the year 2000.

00:00:03.761 --> 00:00:06.681
Zero have ever been criminally charged.

00:00:06.681 --> 00:00:15.079
The highest law enforcement office in Canada — occupied by four consecutive leaders — with zero accountability for systemic institutional failure.

00:00:15.079 --> 00:00:18.602
Twenty-two people killed in the Nova Scotia mass shooting.

00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:23.181
The RCMP failed to issue a public alert for over twelve hours.

00:00:23.181 --> 00:00:27.238
One hundred and thirty recommendations from the Mass Casualty Commission.

00:00:27.238 --> 00:00:29.749
Most remain unimplemented.

00:00:29.749 --> 00:00:37.329
Ten point five million dollars paid to Maher Arar after the RCMP provided false intelligence that led to his torture in Syria.

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:46.397
One hundred million dollars in the Merlo-Davidson class action settlement — covering twenty thousand female RCMP members who experienced harassment within the force.

00:00:46.397 --> 00:00:53.261
Three undeclared Beijing police stations operated on Canadian soil — in Toronto — for diaspora intimidation.

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:57.397
The RCMP closed the investigation with zero charges.

00:00:57.397 --> 00:01:05.147
Political interference allegations: a Commissioner allegedly pressured staff to release firearms data to support government gun legislation.

00:01:05.147 --> 00:01:06.727
Four leaders.

00:01:06.727 --> 00:01:08.761
Zero accountability.

00:01:08.761 --> 00:01:11.931
One hundred and thirty ignored recommendations.

00:01:11.931 --> 00:01:14.181
The pattern is not failure.

00:01:14.181 --> 00:01:16.215
The pattern is design.
